Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.33,0:00:07.34,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)}翻译/压制/字幕制作：HAF半个水果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.21,0:00:18.21,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1951.704,1855.407)}使用AI工具翻译，如有不准确的地方请在弹幕或评论区指正，谢谢！\N！！真的有人看不到这行字！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.51,0:00:28.51,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1956.149,1882.519)}翻译质量权威评价：原来25年就有小拉即用机翻糊弄人了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.54,0:00:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,五年半前 \N5 and a half years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.92,0:00:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我做了个恶搞视频 调侃Windows 10即将停止支持\NI made a joke video about Windows 10 reaching its end of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.94,0:00:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,而搭载全新NT11内核的新版Windows\NAnd a new Windows version with an all-new NT11 kernel,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,将永远取代它\Nreplacing it forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,在2020年 那是个愚人节恶搞视频\NIn 2020, it was an April Fool's video.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,当时 微软曾多次表示\NBack in the day, Microsoft said countless times,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.42,0:00:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Windows 10将是微软发布的最后一个Windows版本 \NWindows 10 will be the last ever version of Windows to be released.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,或许我对全新NT11内核的预测有误 \NI might have been wrong about the all-new NT11 kernel,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.64,0:00:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,但我确实预见到了这一天的到来 \Nbut I certainly predicted this day would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,就在我说话这会儿 距离Windows 10正式终止支持只剩三天 \NAs I'm talking, it's three days before Windows 10 reaches its official end of support date.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.64,0:00:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是2025年10月11日深夜 \NIt is the late evening of October 11th, 2025.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.02,0:00:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,时光流转确实令人着迷\NI'm certainly mesmerized by the flow of time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是它流逝的速度\Nparticularly its velocity,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,而我愿将这支视频化作我们共同时代的墓志铭\Nand I wanted this video to be sort of a tombstone to an era we've lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.62,0:00:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们中许多人未曾抵达的里程碑 \NIt's a milestone some of us hadn't reached.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,无论是新冠疫情的影响 \NBe it because of COVID,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.39,0:01:00.01,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fscx454\fscy383\pos(2432,1254.667)}█
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,还是因为世界各地的战乱\Nbe it because of wars around the globe,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.49,0:01:00.01,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1925.334,1809.334)}*HAF：基本国外的地图都会有问题，外国人很难找到或辨别正确的地图*
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.60,0:00:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,还是其他种种缘由 \Nany other reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.12,0:01:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们将基本自由拱手相让的十年\NIt's the decade in which we left our basic freedoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.34,0:01:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,消费者权益 \NConsumer Rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,未经审查与管制的互联网 \NUncensored and unregulated internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.58,0:01:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,艺术尊严已被悄然剥夺 \NArtistic dignity has been stolen from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.33,0:01:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Windows 10存在的这十年 彻底改变了我们的生活方式 \NThe 10 years Windows 10 has lived for brought monumental changes to how we live,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.51,0:01:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,交往模式 乃至爱憎深浅 \Nhow we interact, and even how much we love and hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.18,0:01:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那段经历让我受益匪浅 我开始频繁地与她互动交流\NMy experience with that was so positive. I started to just engage with her all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们正在组装这台电脑。Smith彻底告别了社交媒体和谷歌搜索 把所有这些东西都换成了人工智能\NAll right, we're building this PC. Smith ditched social media and Google searches and replaced it all with Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.21,0:01:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,回溯2015年 那时我甚至不曾创作视频 \NBack in 2015, I didn't even make videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.15,0:01:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然尝试上传过几何取巧攻略 \NI mean, I was trying to upload videos about cheeky geometry-secret ways,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.23,0:01:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但尚未成为Enderman \Nbut I wasn't Enderman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.49,0:02:02.13,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1933.333,1734.667)}我所有关于Enderman之前的视频都随时间消失了，实在可惜……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.39,0:01:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,连“Ender秀”都未成形——\NAnd I wasn't even Ender's show.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.19,0:01:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那时我才念五年级 \NI was in 5th grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.51,0:01:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我的曾祖母尚在人世\NMy great-grandma was still alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.29,0:02:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对未来仍充满迷茫\Nand I was clueless about my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.29,0:02:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Windows XP在2014年停止支持\NWindows XP reached its end of life in 2014,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.53,0:02:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那时距此仅过一年\Njust a year ago back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.21,0:02:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,想想Windows 10生命周期里的剧变\NThink about how much has changed during the Windows 10's lifetime,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.77,0:02:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,以及我们失去的珍贵事物\Nand how much we have primarily lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.91,0:02:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,它们如同白昼阳光\NThey're like daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.33,0:02:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我拉上窗帘便能创造属于自己的天地\NI can close my curtains and it's gonna be amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.67,0:02:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(2480,2065)}Windows 10为我定义了一个时代\NWindows 10 defined an era for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.68,0:02:26.58,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(810.666,1868)}这是我的一台旧笔记本电脑\N宏碁Aspire 7530G。它产自2008年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.65,0:02:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(2325.333,2089)}正如Windows 7曾经那样\Nmuch like Windows 7 did,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.25,0:02:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(2640,2081)}只是对更早的岁月我无话可说\Nexcept I don't have much to say about older times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.68,0:02:30.94,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fscx86\fscy88\pos(1890.666,217.333)}而这个是我珍贵的自制三脚架\N它诞生于2020年。磨砂屏幕才是王道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.01,0:02:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那段时光未曾留下太多印记\NI just don't have enough experiences from back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.81,0:02:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我最常将Windows 10与宏碁掠夺者联系在一起\NThe device I primarily associate Windows 10 with is the Acer Predator,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.39,0:02:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那台2018年12月入手的著名猛兽\Nthe infamous beast I got in December of 2018.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.91,0:02:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,此后它已被更换过两次\NSince then, it has been replaced twice,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.35,0:02:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,具体经历我想另做视频细说\Nwhich I want to talk about in a separate video.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.24,0:02:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,或许你已注意到新笔电出现在我的视频里\NYou might have noticed a new laptop made its way into my videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.61,0:02:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 这就是我现在使用的伙伴\NWell, that's the guy I use now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.85,0:02:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,微星Vector\NMSI Vector.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.95,0:02:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,去年刚入手的装备\NI got it last year now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.65,0:02:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 \NOh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.47,0:02:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但这台笔记本将承载我对Windows 11的记忆\NBut it's the laptop I'll be associating with Windows 11,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.15,0:02:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管它本是Windows 10的天然继任者\Ndespite it being a natural successor to Windows 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.81,0:03:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,到那时 Windows 11 已经变得相当好用了 \NBy that point, Windows 11 has become usable,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.69,0:03:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏了Startleback的优化\Nthanks to Startleback,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.59,0:03:09.71,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1925.333,1745.334)}我并非受StartAllBack赞助才这么说 纯粹是它确实出色
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.93,0:03:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,以及Windows 11正式发布后持续四年的完善改进\Nand the 4 entire years Windows 11 has been in post-release development.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得自己老了吗？\NDo you feel old yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.55,0:03:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 让我们再次迎接宏碁掠夺者 \NAnd so, say hello again to Acer Predator,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.41,0:03:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这台设备将伴我处理日常事务 直到Windows 10彻底退出历史舞台 \Nwhich I will be using for my everyday tasks until Windows 10 dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.15,0:03:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我差点忘了自己有多钟爱这个设计理念\NI actually forgot how much I loved this design choice,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.45,0:03:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,外接显示器和键鼠 加上各种外接 完全把它当作台式主机来使用 \Nand how I actually never used neither the trackpad nor the keyboard on the laptop because I used it as a desktop with
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.57,0:03:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,外接显示器和键鼠 加上各种外接 完全把它当作台式主机来使用\Nexternal...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.53,0:03:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,外接显示器和键鼠 加上各种外接 完全把它当作台式主机来使用\Neverything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那时我特别钟爱青轴机械键盘 \NBack then I was a fan of blue switches,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.45,0:03:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,直到我体验了屈蹲弹簧轴 \Nuntil I tried buckling springs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,从此再没换过其他轴体 \NI never looked back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.89,0:03:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我现在面临两个选择 \NSo I have two options here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.77,0:03:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,要么选择当年与掠夺者配套使用的经典青轴键盘\Neither a period correct blue switch keyboard that I actually used with the Predator,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.13,0:03:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,或者选择IBM Model M键盘——这款我在使用掠夺者的最后阶段确实短暂接触过\Nor the IBM Model M, which I did use a little bit with the Predator at the very end,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就在我最终购置台式机的前几个月\Njust a couple months before I finally got a desktop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.23,0:03:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多也是在这段时间 掠夺者开始出现一些小故障\NIt's also around time when Predator started malfunctioning a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.11,0:03:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我继续使用着它\NI kept using it regardless,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但种种迹象表明该换设备了\Nbut it started showing I needed a replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.73,0:04:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,如果说更换风扇还算小事\NIf a fan replacement isn't that big of a deal,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.93,0:04:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那内存插槽损坏可就棘手了\Na broken RAM slot is pretty rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没掌握维修这种故障的技能\NI'm not that skilled to fix that myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这很可能是因为焊接工艺不过关\Nand that's probably because of poor soldering quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.24,0:04:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,经过这么多年使用 接触点肯定已经老化了\NThe contacts must have cracked after so many years of use.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.42,0:04:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这两款键盘可以说都是原装正品\NBoth of these keyboards are authentic,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.38,0:04:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我想我会选择更老的那把键盘\Nso to speak, but I think I'll choose the older keyboard,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.52,0:04:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我相信这样能让我更欣赏弹簧的手感\Nbecause I believe it'll make me appreciate the springs even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,至于外接显示器\NAs for an external display,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我想还是算了吧\NI think I'll pass on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我的桌面实在没有多余空间了\NI just don't have the space on my desk anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.28,0:04:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 组装完成\NAlright, the build is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那么首要任务就是安装Windows 10系统\NAnd so, the first objective is to install Windows 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 系统居然已经装好了\NOh wait, it's already installed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.66,0:04:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 这竟然是我之前用过的旧系统\NHoly cow, that's actually the old install from,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:04:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,记不清具体是什么时候的了\NI don't know when.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.18,0:05:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然重装过几次\NI did reinstall a couple times,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.78,0:05:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但这确实是我换用台式机前实际使用的Windows 10\Nbut it's the Windows 10 that I actually used before switching to the desktop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.24,0:05:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时没有格式化硬盘\NI didn't wipe the drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.46,0:05:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了 这样反而更好\NThat's awesome, that makes it even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.32,0:05:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,来看看现在能用哪些功能\NLet's see what I have to work with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.78,0:05:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,由于台式机坏了\NThe desktop is broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.34,0:05:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我确实取出了第二块硬盘\Nso I did pull out a second drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.62,0:05:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直坚持在物理层面隔离系统数据\NI've always had the system data separation on a physical level.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那块硬盘现在应该还在我的台式机里\NThe drive is probably in my desktop computer right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.56,0:05:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,台式机出故障是因为我把桌面文件都存储在数据盘上\NThe reason it's broken is because I store desktop items on the data drive,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.94,0:05:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,而你看到的这些快捷方式都来自共享桌面\Nand the shortcuts you see are from the shared desktop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我尽可能清理这些快捷方式\NThose I try to eliminate when possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,具体原因说不上来\NI don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.18,0:05:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是强迫症作祟\NProbably OCD.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.96,0:05:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,还留着不少老旧程序 比如WireGuard\NThere's a lot of legacy stuff like WireGuard,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这款软件在2023年左右就因协议问题在俄罗斯被全面封禁\Nwhich was completely blocked in Russia per protocol in like 2023.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.21,0:05:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,系统版本是22H2 这倒说得通\N22H2Build, which does make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我直到2024年还在大学里继续使用这台笔记本\NI kept using the laptop in the university until 2024,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.30,0:06:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,当发现连打开IDE这种基础操作都变得异常缓慢时 我终于决定升级设备\Nand when it felt like an eternity to do basic tasks like opening an IDE I decided to finally upgrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,等到它彻底被束之高阁\NAnd when it was ultimately put on a shelf,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.44,0:06:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我决定拆解笔记本 断开显示屏连接\NI decided to disassemble the laptop and disconnect the display,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.86,0:06:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,为了直接采集显卡输出的视频信号\Nin order to capture the video from the graphics card directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.78,0:06:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我本打算用它做些实验\NI intended to use it for experiments,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.68,0:06:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,比如在真实UEFI笔记本上运行Windows 365\Nlike Windows 365 on a real UEFI laptop,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.94,0:06:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,目标是修复系统故障\Nwith a goal to unbrick it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜计划没能成功\NUnfortunately, that did not work,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,白白浪费了时间\Nand I just lost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.64,0:06:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,有趣的是 老款笔记本在断开显示屏时会自动将图形输出切换到核显的HDMI接口\NIt's super interesting how old laptops automatically redirect all the graphics output to the internal graphics card HDMI
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.42,0:06:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,有趣的是 老款笔记本在断开显示屏时会自动将图形输出切换到核显的HDMI接口\Nport whenever the display is disconnected.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.46,0:06:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但这台设备却不行\NBut not this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.66,0:06:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这实在太糟糕了 意味着无法通过物理方式采集任何视频\NIt's really lame because that means I can't capture anything physically on this laptop,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.20,0:06:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,所有素材都只能在笔记本本地录制\Nso all the footage I'll have to record on the laptop locally,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.78,0:06:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,然后传输到我的NAS存储\Nto then send it to my NAS,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.36,0:06:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,最后才能使用\Nand only then use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.12,0:06:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我收藏中唯一无法使用采集卡的设备\NSo far it's the only outlier in my collection that doesn't work with capture cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,实在遗憾 我原本想让它出现在视频作品中\NThis is a shame, because I wanted to feature it in my videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.66,0:07:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这款笔记本的组装结构也相当棘手\NAnd the assembly of this laptop is really treacherous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.88,0:07:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,仿佛设计者竭尽全力阻止用户拆解\NIt's as if they are trying to keep you out as much as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.58,0:07:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,本该简单的插拔操作最终演变成耗时一小时的屏幕拆解\NWhat could have been a simple unplug turned into an hour-long display disassembly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.34,0:07:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,只因没有标准接口\NAll because there is no connector,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.20,0:07:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,所有线缆都直接焊死在主板上\Nand all the wires are soldered directly to the motherboard,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,要断开显示屏只能整体拆卸\Nand the only way to disconnect the display is to take it out completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.42,0:07:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这种设计实在令人恼火 我深恶痛绝\NIt's just so obnoxious, I hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.54,0:07:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,最讽刺的是 折腾半天却毫无用处\NAnd in the end, it doesn't even work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这本该是集成显卡最基本的功能\NThe most basic feature of an integrated graphics card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,难道会有人需要这种设计？\NWhy would anyone need it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.06,0:07:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,而且完全没有相关说明文档\NAnd it's not documented either,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.70,0:07:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能盲目尝试\Nso I went into this blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.00,0:07:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,根本别无选择\NThere is no other option.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我想表达的观点\NSo this is what I'm trying to convey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.08,0:07:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,科技越发展 对消费者反而越不利\NThe further we go, the worse for the consumer the technology gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,之前在制作Win7系统终结视频时\NI wouldn't be able to rant like this during the Windows 7 end of life video,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:53.38,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1928,1716.001)}联想G570还提供显示接口的即时接入功能
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那台宏碁笔记本电脑运行得非常顺畅，\Nbecause that Acer laptop worked swimmingly,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,而且它的可维修性很强\Nand it's very repairable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.70,0:07:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,平心而论 虽然内部设计略显不足\NAlthough a little poorly designed from the inside, to be fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.82,0:07:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但至少没有恶意\NThere was no ill intent there,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:07:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不像现在这款设备 这正是我想表达的意思\Nunlike here, is what I'm trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何 首日体验即将结束\NAnyways, the first day is coming to an end,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我将尝试通过Windows更新给Windows 10升级\Nand I'll try upgrading Windows 10 to its latest release using Windows Update.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便把应用程序也升级一下\NMaybe upgrade the apps as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.60,0:08:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,基本上就是让它跟上时代 \Nbring it up to speed basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.26,0:08:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,并为周一的正式使用做好全面准备\NAnd generally prepare for the Monday,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我既是上班族又是学生\Nsince I'm employed and I'm a student,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,真不走运 \Nunfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.52,0:08:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,估计要一直忙到周日才能完成 \NIt's probably going to spill over to the Sunday,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不过没关系 这个周末我已经安排妥当了 \Nbut it's fine, because I have this weekend sorted out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的挑战会呈指数级增长 \NSuch a challenge gets exponentially harder,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.90,0:08:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,年纪越大 挑战越艰巨 \Nthe older you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.48,0:08:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,等我有孩子以后 估计你们得一年都看不到我更新视频了 \NOnce I have kids, I bet you guys won't see an upload from me in like a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.76,0:08:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜现实就是如此 \NIt's just how it is, unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.84,0:08:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,结果我还是多待了一会儿 \NIn the end, I stayed a little bit more,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.86,0:08:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,并着手推进升级流程的进展 \Nand tried to make a dent in the upgrade process.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.60,0:08:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是天赐良机 \NIt was the perfect opportunity,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.20,0:08:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,因为天气实在太糟糕了\Nbecause the weather was complete garbage,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.78,0:08:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,而且糟糕得喘不来气 \Nand it's not even funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.22,0:08:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那是一场倾盆大雨 狂风肆虐 视线模糊 \NIt was a heavy rain, with obliterating wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.56,0:08:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我成功避开了那台笔记本电脑下载Windows 10更新的风暴 \NI successfully waited out the storm of Windows 10 updates being downloaded to that laptop,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.36,0:08:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,然后就去睡了 \Nand went to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,第二天我花时间安装了各种集成开发环境 \NThe following day I spent installing IDEs,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.82,0:09:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,通讯软件 VPN客户端 编辑配置文件\Nmessengers, VPNs, editing configs,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,还顺便放松了一下 \Nand just chilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.78,0:09:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我还看了会儿YouTube视频 \NI did watch some YouTube,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.28,0:09:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,播放效果棒极了 \Nwhich went fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.82,0:09:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,总体而言 这台笔记本电脑相当实用 \NOverall, the laptop was rather usable,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.30,0:09:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管偶尔会出现卡顿 \Nalbeit laggy at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.24,0:09:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,与我新笔记本电脑相比 性能下降相当明显 \NThe performance decrease compared to my new laptop was noticeable,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.72,0:09:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但差一点就让我无法忍受了 \Nbut it was just on the edge of being a dealbreaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.30,0:09:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,然而一旦拔掉电源 它就完全没法用了 \NUnplugged, however, it was totally unusable,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这确实有违笔记本电脑的设计初衷\Nwhich contradicts the idea of a laptop,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我其实从未真正把它当便携设备使用\Nbut I never really used it as a laptop anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.36,0:09:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这点对我而言倒也无妨\Nso that's a pass from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.12,0:09:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,入手时我就预判电池应该已经报废了\NGoing in, I assumed the battery would be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.76,0:09:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,确实在2022年更换过一次电池\NI did have to replace the battery once,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.80,0:09:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,当时因为电池鼓包彻底失效\Nin 2022, because it puffed up and died.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这台用了四年的笔电竟存在安全隐患\NAn actual hazard 4 years into the laptop's lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.36,0:09:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然更换后的电池确实存在容量衰减\NAnd while the replacement battery actually did lose in capacity,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但衰减程度比预期要好得多\Nit wasn't as significant as I would have thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.62,0:09:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,电量从20%到0%只需一分钟\NIt went from 20-ish percent to 0 in a minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.02,0:09:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但除此之外 满电状态下仍能支撑一整小时的轻度办公使用 \Nbut otherwise, an entire hour of light work could be yielded from one full charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.04,0:09:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,作为参考 原装电池\NFor reference, the old battery,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.94,0:09:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,当笔记本还是全新的时候\Nwhen the laptop was brand new,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.46,0:10:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,满电最多也就撑一个半小时\Nlasted an hour and a half at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.80,0:10:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我确实订阅过这个服务 \NWhich I did subscribe to,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.64,0:10:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,考虑到我的实际使用场景\Nconsidering my use case,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.06,0:10:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这完全公平合理 \Nso it's perfectly fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.66,0:10:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,随着时间流逝\NAs the day had passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.24,0:10:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我已为工作日可能出现的各种状况做好了充分准备 \NI got pretty much prepared for anything the workweek would possibly throw at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.42,0:10:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,于是我便收工休息了 \Nand so I called it a day,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,因为天气持续恶化 我熬到深夜都没睡\Nstayed up super late because the weather just kept deteriorating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.08,0:10:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,从暴雨转成雨夹雪 还刮起更恼人的冷风\NFrom a heavy rain into a sparse wintry mix and even more annoying cold wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.84,0:10:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本没法按正常时间入睡\NI just couldn't sleep at a normal time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.74,0:10:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,更雪上加霜的是 那天还得七点起床\NMultiply this by the fact I had to wake up at 7 that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.26,0:10:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,醒来后我立刻进入状态\NSo I woke up, immediately locked in,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.26,0:10:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,心知这将是2025年最糟糕的日子之一\Nknowing this would be one of the worst days I'll have in 2025,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.64,0:10:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,查看着导航地图\Nnavigated through the source map.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.96,0:10:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,注意到这天气有多恶劣\NNotice how putrid the weather is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,开车条件已经不能更糟了\NIt couldn't get any worse for driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.30,0:10:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,准时进入网课 准备开始学习\NHop on the lecture, time to be productive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.28,0:10:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,结果你猜怎么着\NGuess what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.70,0:10:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,连接笔记本电源时发现充不进电\NI connect the laptop and there's no power coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.46,0:10:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我第一反应是插座坏了\NMy first thought is that the power outlet is bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.88,0:10:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟大家都知道这些公共设施维护得不太好\Nbecause we all know they're not particularly looked after.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,换了个插座 还是不行\NTry another one, still no luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.34,0:11:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,再换一个 依然没反应\NAnother one, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,让朋友试插他的笔记本\NAsk my friend to plug in his laptop,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,居然能正常充电\Nit magically works.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.34,0:11:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这下破案了\NWell, there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,只有两种可能\NThere are two options,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.90,0:11:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,要么是电源适配器坏了\Neither the power brick is dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.80,0:11:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,要么是电源接口接触不良\Nor the power connector contacts cracked,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.42,0:11:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,众所周知这对宏碁笔记本来说是家常便饭\Nwhich as we all know is rather normal for Acer laptops.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.64,0:11:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我试着晃动插头\NI tried wiggling it around,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,从各个角度尝试连接\Nconnecting it from all the angles,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.82,0:11:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但完全没反应\Nand I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.44,0:11:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就是充不进去\NIt doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.58,0:11:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真是见鬼\NWell, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,看来现在只能靠电池撑着了\NI guess I have to use the battery now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.10,0:11:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,而我还连着有两节课要上\Nand I have two lectures in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.94,0:11:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,电池撑不了三小时记笔记和上网\NIt's not gonna have enough power for three hours of writing things down and browsing the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.50,0:11:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,最离谱的是凌晨两点在家还好好的\NThe stupidest part is that it worked perfectly at 2am at home,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.58,0:11:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,收拾完带到这里\Nthen I pack it up, bring it here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.58,0:11:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,早上八点突然就坏了\Nat 8am, and it doesn't work all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.00,0:11:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这运气也是没谁了\NWhat kind of luck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.68,0:11:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是该去买张彩票？\NShould I just buy a lottery ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不过还是不确定是接口接触不良\NStill, it was unclear whether the contacts cracked,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.54,0:11:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,还是电源坏了 或者我运气爆棚\Nor the brick died, or maybe I was super lucky even,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.12,0:12:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,两个故障同时发生\Nand both of these happened simultaneously.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好工作上没什么紧急任务\NAnyways, luckily there weren't any urgent tasks on my jobs,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.74,0:12:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这种背刺来得猝不及防\Nbecause this knife into my back,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.76,0:12:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,完全出乎意料\NI did not expect at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,反正课程内容也都是凑数的\NAnd the lectures were just filler content anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.24,0:12:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,倒也无所谓\Nso there's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.28,0:12:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,回家后\NWhen I got back home,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.08,0:12:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须验证一个猜想\NI had to test a theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好备着通用笔记本充电器\NThankfully, I had a universal charger for most laptops,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.60,0:12:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然最高只有60瓦\Neven though it's capped at 60 watts,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.74,0:12:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,而掠夺者本要180瓦\Nand Predator consumes 180.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.87,0:12:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但刚好能测试要不要拍这期视频\NIt was just enough to check whether I would upload this video,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.71,0:12:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是电源故障\Naka it was a power break,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,或许几小时内能在城里找到替代品\Nwhich I could potentially acquire somewhere in the city in a couple of hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.27,0:12:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,要是充电口完全脱焊\Nor I would go down with a ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.05,0:12:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那就只能跟着这台电脑一起报废了\Naka it was a charging port that completely unsoldered itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.89,0:12:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好在接上就能充电\NLuckily, it started charging,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.43,0:12:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,完全不用调整插头角度\Nand I didn't even care about the charger's position.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.39,0:12:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,接口没问题\NThe contacts were fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:13:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,现在只需尽快搞个电源适配器\Nso all I had to do was to source out a power brick ASAP,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.33,0:13:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,四十分钟后我就弄到了\Nwhich I did in 40 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.83,0:13:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟得开车去取\Nand that's because I had to drive for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.73,0:13:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我联系的第一家笔记本配件商就传来喜讯 他们备有原装180瓦宏碁替换电源适配器\NThe first laptop parts supplier I called happily announced they have an original 180 watt Acer replacement brick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.37,0:13:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你瞧 这简直就是藏了个头彩在那儿 \NYou know, literally hid a jackpot there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.93,0:13:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,总而言之 那个周一我全耗在更换电源适配器上了 \NAll in all, the Monday I spent replacing the power brick,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.21,0:13:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,工作 以及参加在线课程 \Nworking, and attending online classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.21,0:13:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,多年后我还抽空测试了这台掠夺者的游戏性能 \NI also had a little bit of time to test game performance on the Predator after so many years,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.03,0:13:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,结果并不令人意外 \Nand the results weren't shocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.99,0:13:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这台笔记本已成历史了 \NThis laptop is history now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.73,0:13:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,在中等画质下运行CS2时帧率仅40帧 还时不时卡顿 \NCS2 on medium settings ran at 40 FPS with occasional freezes,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.43,0:13:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,根本没法正常游玩 \Nand it was unplayable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,值得一提的是 这些测试过程我都是边录屏边进行的\NI think it's worth noting that I was recording while doing these tests as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.25,0:13:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,抛开常规测试标准不谈\NForget the usual metrics,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.29,0:13:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这其实是个Enderman视频\Nit's an Enderman video.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.21,0:13:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,之所以作为压力测试 主要是因为我习惯录制游戏实况\NIt's a stress test primarily because I would almost always record my games,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,加上采集卡无法连接\Nand because I couldn't connect my capture card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.39,0:13:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这测试结果很正常\NSo it's pretty normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.05,0:13:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,完全在意料之中\Nit's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.44,0:14:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,《空洞骑士》在默认设置下运行相当流畅\NHollow Knight ran pretty good on default settings,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.34,0:14:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,完全可以正常游玩\Nand it was very playable,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.94,0:14:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这款游戏本身比这台笔记本还要年长\Nbut the game is obviously older than the laptop,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.38,0:14:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这结果合情合理\Nso it makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.72,0:14:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒是想试试在它上面玩《丝之歌》\NI would try playing Silksong on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.64,0:14:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我的技术还不太行\Nbut I'm not that great yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.14,0:14:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,得先把《空洞骑士》通关再说\NI wanna beat Hollow Knight first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.13,0:15:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,《四叶草深渊》只能跑到40帧\NClover Pit ran at 40 FPS.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.57,0:15:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,现在问题来了 这游戏怎么会卡成这样？\NNow the question is, how does that run so horrid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.35,0:15:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我严重怀疑不是硬件问题\NI highly doubt it's a hardware issue,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.05,0:15:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,多半是游戏优化太差\Nit's probably just super unoptimized.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.43,0:15:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但这表现确实让我大跌眼镜\NBut it took me by surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:15:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便说句题外话\NAnd just so you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.63,0:16:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才这个旋转动作让我直接笑喷了\NI burst out laughing after this spin,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.07,0:16:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这画面简直离谱到编都编不出来\Nbecause you can't make this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.81,0:16:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我也赶不上截止日期了\NI wouldn't pass the deadline anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.37,0:16:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,所以无所谓啦\Nso it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.50,0:16:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,《几何冲刺》的表现倒是惊艳\NAnd Geometry Dash, oh gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.02,0:16:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无疑问运行得非常流畅\NNo question, it just works great,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.24,0:16:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,直接跑满了144帧\Nmanaging to run at full 144 FPS.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.38,0:16:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在背景里听到的杂音\NAnd what you hear in the background,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.06,0:16:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是宏碁掠夺者内置麦克风的录音\Nis the mic of the Acer Predator.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.36,0:16:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得它以前没这么差劲啊\NI don't remember it being that bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.74,0:16:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,但这音质真是糟糕透顶\Nbut god damn it sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.00,0:16:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,捂住耳朵\NCover your ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.56,0:16:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像一直用的都是外接麦克风\NI think I always used an external mic with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.94,0:16:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我觉得这录音很真实\NNonetheless, I believe it's authentic,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你们听听这音质多垃圾\Nyou listen to how trash it sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.71,0:17:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,真没开玩笑\NI'm not even kidding,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.01,0:17:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我一次就通关了\Nit took me one attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.43,0:17:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么啊兄弟？\NWhat the hell, dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.71,0:17:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,哥们我好久没玩这游戏了\NDude, I have not played this game in so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.67,0:17:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么变得这么简单？\NWhy is this so easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.97,0:17:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好\NGood morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.45,0:17:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Windows 10已经宣告死亡\NWindows 10 has died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.73,0:17:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是10月14日\NToday is October 14th.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.87,0:17:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我面前摆着这家伙\NAnd I have this guy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.05,0:17:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然还没整理床铺\NWell, I didn't make my bed yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不过无所谓了\Nbut it doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.19,0:17:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,看看有没有什么变化\NJust see if anything has changed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.07,0:17:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便说一句 天气放晴了\NThe weather cleared up, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.99,0:18:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,之前下雨难道是因为Win10的“临终痛苦”？\NWasn't the Windows 10 agony that was causing all the rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.57,0:18:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 有通知吗？\NOkay, any notification?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.12,0:18:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,如你所见 2025年10月14日\NAs you can see, October 14th, 2025.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.26,0:18:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这是生命周期的终结\NIt's the end of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.08,0:18:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Windows 10支持服务终止\NEnd of support for Windows 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.44,0:18:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,打开VPN连接\NOpen VPN connect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.16,0:18:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 和我想的不一样\NOkay, that's not what I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.38,0:18:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,至少该有个通知吧\NAt least a notification.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,难道真的什么都不提示吗？\NIs there going to be anything at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.06,0:18:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得在网上看过Win10终止支持的提醒\NI remember seeing the Windows 10 end of life notification online,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.74,0:18:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但不确定我这里会不会弹窗\Nbut I'm not sure if I'm gonna spawn it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.28,0:18:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,或许需要先通过Windows更新下载组件才能触发\NMaybe it requires Windows Update to download things to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.12,0:18:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们拭目以待吧\NAnyways, we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.06,0:18:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,回到正题\NBack to the video.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.54,0:18:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,就在我说话的时候\NWell, as I'm speaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.46,0:18:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,今天确实是10月14日 Windows 10确实已经终止支持\Nit is October 14th and Windows 10 has indeed died.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.84,0:18:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但并没有发生什么突然的变化\NBut there's nothing abrupt that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.38,0:18:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我甚至没收到任何通知\NI didn't even receive a notification.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.70,0:18:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我猜通知可能会在未来几天内逐步推送\NBut I'm assuming it's going to roll out gradually within the next few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.66,0:18:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Windows更新也毫无动静\NWindows Update is quiet as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.06,0:18:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,情况大致就是这样\Nand that's pretty much it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.42,0:19:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Windows 11终于全面接掌了 \NWindows 11 has finally taken over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.16,0:19:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Windows 10停止支持的特别之处在于：这是首个在系统仍高度实用的情况下迎来的生命周期终点\NWhat's special about Windows 10's end of life is just how much more usable the system in question is at this point
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.68,0:19:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,相较于Windows 7而言\Ncompared to Windows 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Windows 7终止支持时已服役整整十年 \NWindows 7 was 10 years old when it reached its end of life,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.18,0:19:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 Windows 10现在也正好服役满十年了 \Nbut so is Windows 10 right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.62,0:19:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Windows 11是在Windows 10发布六年后推出的\NWindows 11 was released 6 years after Windows 10,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.54,0:19:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,而Windows 10也是如此\Nand so was Windows 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.52,0:19:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,它大约是在Windows 7发布六年后推出的 \NIt was released roughly 6 years after Windows 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.42,0:19:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管有这些相似之处 \NAnd despite all these similarities,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.72,0:19:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但Windows 10在当下的实际可用性仍远胜2020年时的Windows 7 \NWindows 10 remains significantly more usable compared to Windows 7 back in 2020.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.90,0:19:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我始终想不明白其中缘由\NI can't wrap my head around why that is,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,或许硬件性能呈指数级提升 而时间轴却是线性发展的\Nbut maybe the hardware has improved exponentially while the timescale is linear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.04,0:19:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 我不知该将此现象归因于什么\NHonestly, I don't know what to attribute this effect to,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.86,0:19:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但能确定的是 尽管Win10已正式终结 你仍能长期获得更新支持\Nbut all I know is that Windows 10 is dead officially while you can still get updates for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.98,0:19:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,在接下来的某期视频中\NAnd in one of the next videos,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.22,0:19:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我将演示如何继续使用Win10直到2035年左右\NI'll show you how to use Windows 10 up until 2035 or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,总有办法能让这个系统多陪伴我们一段时光\NThere are ways to enjoy that system just a little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.66,0:20:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,只要开发者不停止技术支持 它就能持续运作\NIt's gonna live until the developers start dropping support for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.10,0:20:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,希望这一天不会太快到来\Nwhich I hope isn't happening anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,衷心感谢各位的观看\NThank you so much for watching,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.90,0:20:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,请多保重\Nand take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.06,0:20:25.91,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur90\fad(200,200)\fscx185\fscy188\pos(1890.667,738.666)}在 Youtube 上关注
